Embedded highlights on the infographic are currently arbitrary entries (e.g. '+14 more embedded highlights omitted'). Make them actual highlights: pick the most relevant changed embedded items (largest absolute size delta, or by importance), not just the first/random ones. Lay them out as a table with columns: +/-, Path (elide folder names with ellipsis when too long, e.g. Items/.../bf2 Item.Gbx), Size change. Omit the 'ZIP' marker/extension since effectively everything is a ZIP. Use faint green/red coloring on the size-change column to indicate add/remove. Sort rows by name.